program	conformance/V109_move_in_a_while_condition.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	use of moved variable `r` across loop iterations
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: use of moved variable `r` across loop iterations"
log	"  --> examples/conformance/V109_move_in_a_while_condition.saw:38:24"
log	"     |"
log	" 38 |     while consume_bool(move r) {"
log	"     |                        ^"
log	"   hint: this move is in the loop's CONDITION, which re-evaluates on every iteration, so the second evaluation reads a binding the first one consumed; reassign it before the loop body ends, move a fresh value, or lift the move out of the loop"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
